Error [jet.InvalidEnumDiscriminant]: An enum discriminant must be computable at compile time
  --> tests/ui/computed_enum_unknown.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     First = missing
    |             ^^^^^^^
 Why: The enum number is part of the type layout and must be known before code generation
 Fix: Use an integer literal, a `NAME: comptime { value }` constant, or another compile-time expression
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0035
